{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "root",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🛠 DevOps 手冊\nThe DevOps Handbook",
      "x": -160,
      "y": 1034,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 147,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "file": "tools/工具-價值流圖.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "畫出 5–15 個 process block\n每塊標 lead time／process time／%C/A"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🚀 從哪開始",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 113,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 385,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "file": "tools/工具-部署管線與持續交付.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 575,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "file": "tools/工具-低風險發布模式.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 765,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "版本控管一切・主幹開發（每人每天至少 check in 一次）\n虛擬安燈繩・不可變基礎設施"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ① 流動 Flow",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 593,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "file": "tools/工具-遙測與監控.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "五層遙測・3σ 告警（99.7%）\n開發者共同輪值 on-call・同儕審查取代 CAB"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ② 回饋 Feedback",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1073,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1345,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "file": "tools/工具-無指責事後檢討.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l9",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1535,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "file": "tools/工具-注入故障與韌性演練.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1725,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "改善閃電戰（期間不做功能工作）\n技術選型收斂・單一共用原始碼儲存庫"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ③ 持續學習與實驗",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1553,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1920,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "file": "tools/工具-資安與合規左移.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "四類資安測試進管線・預先核可函式庫\n把低風險變更降級為 standard change"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🔐 資安與合規",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 2033,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    }
